            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.9+2SA.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 9:9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ariphochitsupa hicho chirere cha mwango, wakutana na Siba mtumishi mkpwulu wa Mefiboshethi, ambaye kala ana punda airi. Hinyo punda kala akapakiywa mikahe ya nganu magana mairi, magande gana mwenga ga zabibu za kuuma, matunda gana mwenga gavunwago wakati wa dzoho na chiriba cha uchi wa zabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume achimuuza Siba, “Vino ni vya ani?” Siba achiamba, “Punda ni a kuapandiza atu a nyumba ya mfalume, mikahe na matunda ni chakurya cha hinya anajeshi na uchi wa zabibu ni kpwa ajili ya kuaburudisha hinyo ndioremwa hiko jangbwani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.25+2SA.19.26+2SA.19.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 19:25–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mfalume achiuza, “Na ye mdzukulu wa bwanao a kuphi?” Siba achimuamba mfalume, “Asegere hiko Jerusalemu, mana anaririkana, ‘Rero atu a Iziraeli andaniuyizira ufalume wa tsawe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho mfalume achimuambira Siba, “Mali yosi yokala ya Mefiboshethi ndipho ni yako.” Siba achiamba, “Navumbama kukuishimu bwana wangu mfalume, nami navoya unikubali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume Daudi ariphofika phephi na Bahurimu, kpwatuluka mutu wa mryango wa Sauli aihwaye Shimei mwana wa Gera, achilani kuno anatuluka kondze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achimtsuphira mawe mfalume Daudi na maofisaage gosi, dzagbwe kala ana anajeshi na arindzi malumu uphandewe wa kulume na wa kumotso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye Shimei ariphokala analani waamba hivi, “Phauke! Phauke! We mutu wa kuolaga! Kuna mana tsetsetse! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu akakuriphiza milatso yosi uriyoimwaga ya atu a nyumba ya Sauli ambaye watawala badalaye, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu akamupha utawala mwanao Abusalomu. Lola vino, urivyo tabuni kpwa kukala uwe u muolagadzi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Abishai mwana wa Seruya, achimuuza mfalume, “Kpwa utu wani rino diya ra kufwa rikulani we bwana wangu mfalume? Niruhusu nivuke, nikamkate chitswa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mfalume achimuamba, “Gano ganakuhusuni mwi ana a Seruya? Ichikala iye analani kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu akamuambira, ‘Mlani Daudi,’ ni ani phahi ndiyeuza, ‘Kpwa utu wani munahenda vino?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi achimuambira Abishai, na atumishie osi, “Hebu lolani, hiye mwanangu ariyetuluka mwangu chibiruni, analonda kunituluza roho, ingekala Mubenjamini hiyu? Richanani naye. Mricheni alani, kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiye achiyemlagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chahi Mwenyezi Mlungu andalola mai gachigoniphaha, naye andaniripha manono kpwa ajili ya lana ninayolaniwa rero.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi na atue aenderera kulunga yo njira. Shimei naye waenderera kunyendeka mchechemo wa hinyo mwango kulolana na Daudi kuno anamlani, anamtsuphira mawe na kumtefurira vumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye mfalume na atue osi ariokala phamwenga naye atsoloka muho Joridani, akaremwa sana. Nao achioya phapho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu na hinyo atu osi a Iziraeli atsoloka Jerusalemu, naye Ahithofeli kala a phamwenga nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Hushai, wa mbari ya Ariki, yuya msena wa Daudi ariphomtsolokera Abusalomu, wamuamba, “Mfalume na aishi maisha mare! Mfalume na aishi maisha mare!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Abusalomu achimuuza Hushai, “Dze, higa ndigo manono unagomuonyesa msenao? Mbona kuphihire naye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushai achimjibu Abusalomu achiamba, “Hata sivyo hivyo. Yuya ambaye Mwenyezi Mlungu na atue na atu osi a Iziraeli akamtsambula, ndiye mino ndakala wakpwe, nami ndakala phamwenga naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na chisha, ni ani ambaye ni nimuhumikire? Dze, isikale mwana? Dza viratu nirivyohumikira sowe, ndivyo ndakuhumikira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Abusalomu achimuambira Ahithofeli, “Hebu huphe mashaurigo, huhendedze swino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Ahithofeli achimuambira Abusalomu, “Uwe injira kpwa anachetu a sowe, ambao akaaricha ili atundze dzumba ra chifalume, ndipho Aiziraeli osi andamanya kukala ukamvula nguwo sowe na chila ariye phamwenga nawe andazidi kukuunga mkpwono.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.11+2SA.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 12:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi amchitira hema Abusalomu dzulu ya dari, naye achilala anachetu a ise mbere za Aiziraeli osi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hizo mashauri arigolavya Ahithofeli gakala dza neno rilaro kpwa Mlungu. Hivyo ndivyo Daudi na Abusalomu arivyoishimu mashauri gosi ga Ahithofeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
